<title>USA: SBC Warburg names senior Latin American economist.</title>
<headline>SBC Warburg names senior Latin American economist.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>SBC Warburg Inc said on Thursday it had named Carlos Mederios senior Latin American economist.</p>
<p>The company said Mederios would be mainly responsible for macroeconomic analysis and forecasting in Brazil, as well as econometric work and fiscal issues.</p>
<p>Mederios joins SBC Warburg after nine years at the International Monetary Fund, where he most recently was senior economist for Brazil.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
